  "section": "6.10",
  "rulesText": "&#x23E3; &nbsp; **1d** for each **Action** rating dot.\n\n&#x2295; &nbsp; **+1d** if you have **Assistance**.\n\n&#x2295; &nbsp; **+1d** if you **Push** yourself -or- you accept a **Devil's Bargain**."
}
